{
 "$comment": "Innate-effect numbers for named unique weapons, read from the Patch 70 client data (the enchantments applied by each unique's custom mod). Only uniques whose custom mod matched R.O.L.L.'s unique list by name are included (23 of 83); the rest use perk-driven or differently structured effects and are not guessed here. magnitude is the effect's base value; when a curve is present it is the game's level scaling of that value (x is assumed to be the item level, 1-50, and the base value equals the curve at x = 1). For Damage-archetype effects the magnitude is read as damage per second for durationSeconds, which is how the game phrases the equivalent armor effects, but this was not observed in game. Nothing in the builder reads this file yet.",
 "source": {
  "patch": 70,
  "build": "1.7.26.13",
